cbsheet 1

# Telekinesis (M290: the owner's weapon, here as a skill of the kit until its look is made). Select
# it (slot 6), then:
#   left button       a pull: a ball thrown 18 m along the look holds the first player it meets and
#                     draws them to you for 0.6 s; meanwhile they cannot attack (pulled). 4 s apart
#   right button      held: a ball 6 m along the look (the level stops it short) breaks loose the
#                     walls it touches and holds up to 8 loose bodies at its middle
#   left, holding     what it holds is thrown along the look: a player one strikes within 2 s is
#                     hurt by its speed (brawl.tk.struck: the brawl mod's damage)
# Every simulation runs it (predicted); the damage alone is the server's.

# Its names (the brawl mod's C++ finds them) and its numbers.
status pulled
event brawl.tk.pulled
event brawl.tk.struck
param inventory.start 1
# How it meets the other skills: its tag, and what it waits out (the guard's tag).
tag attack
tag guard
param brawl.tk.reach 6 m
param brawl.tk.pull_speed 14 m/s
param brawl.tk.throw_speed 30 m/s

motion Pull on use if not active Hold
	tags attack
	blocked by guard, pulled
	cooldown 4 s
	lasts 0.6 s
	cast sphere 0.4 range 18 holds players
		emit brawl.tk.pulled
		apply pulled for 0.6 s on target
		steer on target toward owner speed brawl.tk.pull_speed strength 60

motion Hold while held.use2
	blocked by pulled
	break radius 2 speed 2 at look brawl.tk.reach
	grab sphere 3 bodies max 8 at look brawl.tk.reach
		steer toward look brawl.tk.reach speed 12 strength 40

motion Throw on use if active Hold
	tags attack
	find sphere 3 bodies max 8 at look brawl.tk.reach
		throw brawl.tk.throw_speed along look marks brawl.tk.struck for 2 s
